invariant: INV-25
file: srv_parser.c
catches: srv_test
reason: parse_extension stops comparing rb_left for the body it opened, so a
  recognized extension with a byte after its struct parses, and two
  encodings name one value. RFC 9846 §4.3 makes extension_data match its
  struct exactly (rfc9846.txt:1561-1565). test/srv_parser_tests.h gives
  every recognized extension one trailing byte and requires
  decode_error; lint-exact-fill objects to the same edit.

--- old
    if (e.err || rb_left(&e) != 0) {
--- new
    if (e.err) {
